    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1840">

                <pb facs="1471" n="1355" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1355"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 033.1100 K77/98a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 12, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary and party will arrive at La Guaira March 22 and proceed the same
                    day to Caracas. They will depart via Puerto Cabello March 25.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
